% asdg
# Regression fixture: generation IDs must be ordered
# NUMERICALLY, not lexicographically. With 12 generations, a lexicographic
# sort makes '9' the largest generation ID and silently selects generation 9
# as the reference population instead of generation 12.
#
# Structure: a chain. Generation 1 has two founders. Each later generation g
# adds one new founder and one offspring of (new founder x previous animal).
# Every animal has two known parents or none, so the disputed BL-3
# one-parent-known branch is NOT exercised.
#
# animal sire dam generation
1 0 0 1
2 0 0 1
3 1 2 1
4 0 0 2
5 4 3 2
6 0 0 3
7 6 5 3
8 0 0 4
9 8 7 4
10 0 0 5
11 10 9 5
12 0 0 6
13 12 11 6
14 0 0 7
15 14 13 7
16 0 0 8
17 16 15 8
18 0 0 9
19 18 17 9
20 0 0 10
21 20 19 10
22 0 0 11
23 22 21 11
24 0 0 12
25 24 23 12
